orow(40, 11, 'MATERIAL', f'OR, SINCE THE MEASURE OF GOOD EXCEEDS THE MEASURE OF PUNISHMENT — NOT IN MY POWER TO CURSE IN THE HOUSE AS IN THE FIELD? "YOU BROUGHT IT HOME AND I BLEW ON IT" (Haggai 1:9); "THE CURSE, THE CONFUSION AND THE REBUKE" (28:20); THE STORE — "CURSED IN THE CITY" (28:16); THE DOUGH (28:17); COMING AND GOING (28:19); "YOU SHALL EAT AND NOT BE SATISFIED" (Leviticus 26:26); THE INNARDS (Micah 6:14) — WORM AND ROT, SOURED WINE, RANCID OIL. The row on 11:12 ({SP_(40, 11, "שמדת", "טובה", "מרבה", "ממדת", "פרענות")} "that the measure of good exceeds the measure of punishment"; {SP_(40, 11, "מארה", "בבית")} "a curse in the house"): THE SIX CURSES (28:16-20) THE BLESSINGS\' MIRROR seat for seat — the twin sets the ink measured (28:3/16, 28:5/17, 28:6/19) read by the shelf as one table with two arms. REREAD WHOLE (chapter 11, deu_11_ekev_reeh).')
orow(40, 12, 'MATERIAL', f'R. SIMEON B. YOHAI: A KING WITH MANY SONS AND SERVANTS FED FROM HIS HAND, THE STOREHOUSE KEYS IN HIS HAND — DOING HIS WILL HE OPENS IT AND THEY EAT; NOT, HE LOCKS IT AND THEY STARVE. SO ISRAEL: HIS WILL — "THE LORD OPENS HIS GOOD TREASURE, THE HEAVENS" (28:12); NOT — "HE SHUTS UP THE HEAVENS AND THERE IS NO RAIN" (11:17). The row on 11:12 ({SP_(40, 12, "ומפתחות", "של", "אוצר", "בידו")} "and the keys of the storehouse in his hand"; {SP_(40, 12, "נועל", "את", "האוצר")} "he locks the storehouse"): 28:12 AND 11:17 THE TWO ARMS OF ONE STATE — the rain\'s treasure opened or shut by the will; the compile\'s rain status already on the calendar\'s keys (11:14-17) gains 28:12 as its blessing seat. REREAD WHOLE (chapter 11, deu_11_ekev_reeh).')
orow(42, 8, 'MATERIAL', f'"AND YOU SHALL GATHER YOUR GRAIN" (11:14) — WHY? "THIS BOOK OF THE LAW SHALL NOT DEPART FROM YOUR MOUTH" (Joshua 1:8) AS IT SOUNDS? THE TORAH SPOKE THE WAY OF THE WORLD — R. ISHMAEL; R. SIMEON B. YOHAI: WHEN ISRAEL DOES HIS WILL THEIR WORK IS DONE BY OTHERS (Isaiah 61:5); WHEN NOT, BY THEMSELVES — AND OTHERS\' WORK BY THEM: "YOU SHALL SERVE YOUR ENEMIES" (28:48). The row on 11:14 ({SP_(42, 8, "דרך", "ארץ", "דברה", "תורה")} "the Torah spoke the way of the world"; {SP_(42, 8, "שמלאכת", "אחרים", "נעשה", "על", "ידם")} "that others\' work is done by them"): 28:48\'S SERVICE OF THE ENEMY the labor\'s third state — one\'s own work, others\' work for one, one\'s work for others; the compile\'s curse arm at 28:48 (DV28C-01). REREAD WHOLE (chapter 11, deu_11_ekev_reeh).')
orow(43, 28, 'MATERIAL', f'"AND THE GROUND SHALL NOT YIELD ITS PRODUCE" (11:17) — NOT EVEN WHAT YOU BRING TO IT; A TREE BEAR FRUIT? "THE TREE OF THE FIELD SHALL NOT YIELD" (Leviticus 26:20); WOOD FOR THE OVEN? THE SAME; GO ABROAD AND PROSPER? "YOUR HEAVENS OVER YOUR HEAD BRASS AND THE EARTH UNDER YOU IRON" (28:23) — IN EVERY PLACE. The row on 11:17 ({SP_(43, 28, "ילך", "לחוצה", "לארץ")} "he goes outside the land"; {SP_(43, 28, "בכל", "מקום")} "in every place"): 28:23\'S BRASS AND IRON FOLLOW THE MAN — "your heavens", "under you": the curse\'s SCOPE is the person, not the land (the compile\'s parameter: the drought curse travels). REREAD WHOLE (chapter 11, deu_11_ekev_reeh).')
