orow(291, 6, 'EXCLUDED', f'"THUS SHALL BE DONE TO THE MAN WHO WILL NOT BUILD HIS BROTHER\'S HOUSE" (25:9) — R. ELIEZER: WHO HAS NOT BUILT AND WILL NOT BUILD. The row on 25:9 ({SP_(291, 6, "לא", "בנה", "ואשר", "לא", "עתיד", "לבנות")} "has not built and is not going to build"): the English\'s "Dt.27:9" the misprint for 25:9 (the Hebrew is 25:9\'s own words) — EXCLUDED from chapter 27\'s coverage, read whole. REREAD WHOLE (chapters 22-25, deu_22_25_ki_teitzei).')
